::ingredients

(spaghetti, any kind)
(spices, ground, e.g. cumin or turmeric or paprika or garlic)
(tomato addition) = (tomato paste, preferably with basil and without preservative) -OR- (tomato sauce, preferably with basil and without preservative)
(extra virgin olive oil) a generous amount
(water)
(salt, if needed)
(pepper, if needed)
(bacon, optional)
(turkey, optional)
(egg, optional)

